  "term": "SOA",
  "definition": "SOA stands for sense of agency, meaning a person’s felt sense of being in control of their actions and of how those actions affect the outside world. In this source, it is described as having implicit and explicit forms, with the more explicit and general aspect measured using questionnaires such as the Sense of Agency Scale.",
